That's bogus.

Combat wombats are "straightforward" merely because
spellcasting can be long ignored in a successful
game. They are still subject to precisely the same
game mechanics and considerations as other
characters: buff pets are good, killing stuff
prevents your pet from getting buff by your pet
killing it instead of you killing it; protection is
by far cheapest bought when the PC is at XL:1;
higher XL causes tougher monsters, and so on.
 
