racket. A good starting AC with a well enchanted
piece of armor, strong enough to wear lots of
the early, easily found heavy poor quality
unenchanted armor to improve AC without becoming
burdened, a good amount of starting HPs so she is
able to "stand and take it" while her pet runs to
her rescue, or to stand waiting beside the pet who
is in melee to attempt first grabs at a corpse.

